### Reminder — works while app is closed
POST https://{{host}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}/{{exchange}}/publish
Authorization: Basic {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": {},
  "routing_key": "{{userId}}",
  "payload": "reminder|Training Reminder|Your training starts in 30 minutes",
  "payload_encoding": "string"
}

### Event notification — only while app is open
POST https://{{host}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}/{{exchange}}/publish
Authorization: Basic {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": {},
  "routing_key": "{{userId}}",
  "payload": "event|New Event|Stage Naigairyu has been added to the calendar",
  "payload_encoding": "string"
}

